What about a ladders in nethack? In current nethack you can dig pits to
travel quickly downward, but to go up you have to use the staircases.
(We'll leave level teleportation out of the discussion)
Ladders would have various sizes and when put in a pit/trapdoor you
could create your own staircases. Depending on the length it could cover
one or more levels. If not made of aluminum it would be too heavy to
carry with you all of the time. It could help you to cross pits or
gullies ( an arid version of a moat, but because of its endless depth
equally lethal) and perhaps you could even climb some castle walls with it.

"They say that if you cannot dig through a wall, you should try to climb it"

Ernst Lubach

